BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (Renewal tracking deserves stronger controls than speculative lead scoring because its cost is both) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.70 Tm (predictable and repetitive. Reconcile registrar exports, invoices, and the internal inventory weekly, with desk) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 274.47 Tm (alerts at 90, 60, and 30 days before the recorded renewal date. Those are internal reminders, not) Tj ET
